# Scope of the ubs step (scripts/ubs_scan.sh, fa-0hs4.2).
#
# Test code: a test panic! is not a production panic! (the step's fa-lbh
# contract). Every src/ path these patterns match compiles only under
# cfg(test), directly or through a #[path] or nested `mod tests` (checked
# 2026-10-29, b4fff298b); integration tests live under tests/.
tests/
tests.rs
*_tests.rs
*_tests/
# Not Rust: a clippy.toml's disallowed-methods list names std::thread::spawn,
# which the resource-lifecycle heuristic reads as a spawn without a join.
clippy.toml
